    "「秒跳1」每秒一跳，跳完后像老钟一样短暂颤一下就停；「秒跳2」每秒跳 4 格。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Tick 1” jumps once per second with a brief recoil like a mechanical clock; “Tick 4” jumps four times per second."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「秒跳1」每秒一跳，跳完后像老钟一样短暂颤一下就停；「秒跳2」每秒跳 4 格。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
