    "一次性买断，去掉顶部与底部横幅广告。本地可用 Products.storekit 测试；上架前请在 App Store Connect 创建同名商品 %@。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One-time purchase removes the top and bottom banner ads. Test locally with Products.storekit; create a matching product %@ in App Store Connect before release."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一次性买断，去掉顶部与底部横幅广告。本地可用 Products.storekit 测试；上架前请在 App Store Connect 创建同名商品 %@。"
